Codex Meter

Codex Meter's Codex Agent status light feature is inspired by Agent Signal Bar:

  https://github.com/guan-ops/Agent-Signal-Bar

Agent Signal Bar is an Apache-2.0 licensed local-first macOS signal-light app
for AI agents. Copyright 2026 XiongYang Guan.

The Codex Meter integration is a Codex-only reimplementation for this project.
It does not bundle Agent Signal Bar images, sounds, icons, screenshots, brand
assets, or app resources.
